# Copy this file to ".env" to choose where data is kept (the SQLite database
# and every stored PDF live there).
#
# Precedence: an existing DATA_DIR environment variable > this file > the
# default ".data" beside the app.
#
# - A relative path resolves against this folder.
# - An absolute path is used as-is, so data can live outside the project.
#
# Windows example:  DATA_DIR=D:\invoice-data
# macOS / Linux:    DATA_DIR=/Users/you/invoice-data
DATA_DIR=.data
